    {
      "id": "blk_4292b27f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "瑝珑最高军事行政机构,在明庭和六州均有设立,明庭军策府长官称之为“军策尚书”,统领六州军务。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_ea700b70",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "各州军策府长官称之为“镇将”,分辖州内军务。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_19425565",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "一般六州军策府镇将都由明庭任命,部分特殊的州郡则可能由岁主选出。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
